The isolated blocks omit registry decorators and adapt checkpoint call spelling
and BF16 interpolation for the installed Torch 2.0 environment. The integration
adds geometry and temporal data contracts, planner adapters, masked auxiliary
losses, and versioned training/evaluation checkpoint dispatch.
